WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.267
-Welcome back, everybody!
Welcome back.

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:05.734
Here at "The Tonight Show,"
we love songs

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.200
