in under an hour.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:12.200
It is time for Battle
of the Instant Songwriters.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.434
Here we go.

00:00:13.434 --> 00:00:16.501
-♪ Singing a song,
and I'm singing a song ♪

