about another song ♪

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.801
-Welcome to Battle
of the Instant Songwriters.

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:25.601
Before the show, we went
through our great audience

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.267
and picked out two people who
said that they were musicians.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.067
We gave them each
a made-up song title

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.467
and gave them an hour
to write an original song

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:33.868
based on that title.

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:36.634
Here's a shot of them practicing
