that you were given?

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.934
-I Think This Airbnb
is Haunted."

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.567
-Ooh. Ooh, that's topical.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.067
We're about to enter
spooky season

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:14.734
