and I will introduce you --

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:26.601
Yeah.
Get in the zone and get ready.

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:28.033
Rachel Rose right there.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:33.033
"I Think This Airbnb
is Haunted."

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:36.200
And now, ladies and gentlemen,
here to perform

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.267
